OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from episode nine of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FMillions are expected to tune in to
OL,11,FFriday's finale of The Celebrity
OL,12,FTraitors, with a contestant from West
OL,13,FSussex still in contention to win.
OL,15,FRomesh Ranganathan, from Crawley, is
OL,16,Fone of the series' five remaining
OL,17,F"faithfuls" who survived Thursday's
OL,18,Fbombshell roundtable banishment.
